A yacht sails $40\text{ km}$ from $A$ to $B$ on a bearing of $045^{\circ}\text{T}$, then $65\text{ km}$ from $B$ to $C$ on a bearing of $120^{\circ}\text{T}$. Find the bearing of $A$ from $C$, correct to the nearest degree.

[tikz]
